Recolor the hardcoded GUI palette to Catppuccin Macchiato.

The egui theme is a plain struct of Color32 constants with no runtime
configuration, so retheming means patching squalr/src/ui/theme.rs.

Not upstream; upstream has no theming support to send this to.
